## Modifying the Project

### Adding Source Files
1. Create `.c` file in `srcs/`
2. Create `.h` file in `incs/`
3. Makefile auto-detects new `.c` files

### Adding Libraries
Edit `srcs/Makefile`:

```makefile
LDFLAGS += -lm  # Add math library
```

### Changing Compiler Flags
Edit `srcs/Makefile` CFLAGS section:

```makefile
CFLAGS += -DMY_DEFINE=1
```

